WEBVTT

video-title-preparation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.202
Shiri

preparation-01
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.100
Fara da wanke hannuwa, ka busar.

preparation-02
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Kunna hasken BIO. Danna maɓallin sau biyar don samun haske mafi ƙarfi.

preparation-03
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Na'urar tana kashe kanta bayan daƙiƙa casa'in.

preparation-04
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Sanya BIO a kai. Daidaita madaurin ya zauna lafiya cikin jin daɗi.

preparation-05
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.700
Tsakiya a hanci. Duba babban yatsa a nisan hannu da ido ɗaya-ɗaya.

preparation-06
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:47.100
Maduban su karkata waje, digiri casa'in da layin gani idan ka kalli ƙasa kaɗan.

video-title-fundoscopy-sitting
00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:48.081
Binciken cikin ido a zaune

sitting-01
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:59.900
Faɗaɗa baƙin tsakiyar idanun mara lafiya don ganin cikin ido gaba ɗaya a faɗe.

sitting-02
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:08.500
Lens kusa da ido. Ɗaga fatar sama, sauran yatsu su kwanta a gira da kumatu a hankali.

sitting-03
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:16.300
Lens a nisan hannu, da haske da retina a layi. Inuwar gefe: ba daidai ba.

sitting-04
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Don gefen retina, ya kalli wurare dabam.

sitting-05
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.700
Idan ya zama dole, ya kalli yatsansa a nisan hannu.

sitting-06
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.200
Bayan macula, duba gefe huɗu na fundus.

video-title-fundoscopy-indentation
00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:33.727
Binciken cikin ido tare da dannawa

indentation-01
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:42.000
Ka sanar: yana iya jin rashin daɗi.

indentation-02
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.500
Ya kalli kishiyar wurin dubawa; sa abin dannawa kan wurin.

indentation-03
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:54.000
Ya kalli wurin da ake dubawa, sannan ka danna a hankali.

indentation-04
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.800
Ga misalin duba retina ta sama.

indentation-05
00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.200
Riƙe haske, ruwan tabarau da retina a layi.

indentation-06
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:10.600
Haka za ka iya duba ƙarshen gefen retina mai nisa.
